			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Release: derive mod version from the git tag by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/4\n* Server plugin: Bukkit/Spigot/Paper/Purpur/Folia by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/5\n* Publish the server plugin to Modrinth by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/9\n* Migrate to Architectury Loom (Fabric parity) by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/6\n* Add NeoForge build (1.20.6, 1.21.8) by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/7\n* Publish Quilt tag + collision-free NeoForge version by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/8\n* fix: NeoForge via ModDevGradle (unbreak JDK 25 build) by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/10\n* plugin: publish for all MC versions 1.13–26.2 by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/11\n* One-click IDE run tasks (server + client, any version) by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/12\n* Make the plugin's run tasks visible in the IDE by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/13\n* fix: run plugin dev server on Java 25 for MC 26+ by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/14\n* fix: dev client crashes — make ModMenu compile-only by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/15\n* fix(neoforge): valid modId so the NeoForge mod loads by @iSlavok in https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/pull/16\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/iSlavok/Friendly-Phantoms/compare/v1.1.1...v1.2.0"
